*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.276 841.89]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A3/A3: "<</PageSize[841.70 1190.55]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize TA3/A3 edge-to-edge: "<</PageSize[841.70 1190.55]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize
*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4: "8.5 8.5 586.776 833.39"
*ImageableArea A3: "8.5 8.5 833.20 1182.05"
*ImageableArea TA3: "0 0 841.70 1190.55"
*ImageableArea Letter: "9 9 603 783"
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4: "595.276 841.89"
*PaperDimension A3: "841.70 1190.55"
*PaperDimension TA3: "841.70 1190.55"
*PaperDimension Letter: "612 792"
*OpenUI *InputSlot/Feed: PickOne
*DefaultInputSlot: Rear
*InputSlot Rear/Rear feeder: "<</MediaPosition 0>>setpagedevice"
*InputSlot Cassette/Cassette: "<</MediaPosition 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *InputSlot
*OpenUI *MediaType/Paper: PickOne
*DefaultMediaType: Plain
*MediaType Plain/Plain: "<</MediaType(Plain)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType Photo/Glossy photo: "<</MediaType(Photo)>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *MediaType
*OpenUI *Quality/Engine preset: PickOne
*DefaultQuality: Standard
*Quality Economy/Draft: "<</HWResolution[300 300]>>setpagedevice"
*Quality Standard/Normal: "<</HWResolution[300 300]>>setpagedevice"
*Quality Fine/High engine quality, still 300 dpi input: "<</HWResolution[300 300]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Quality
*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color: PickOne
*DefaultColorModel: RGB
*ColorModel RGB/Color: "<</ProcessColorModel/DeviceRGB>>setpagedevice"
*ColorModel Gray/Monochrome: "<</ProcessColorModel/DeviceGray>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel
*OpenUI *Duplex/Two-sided: PickOne
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Off: "<</Duplex false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Long edge: "<</Duplex true/Tumble false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexTumble/Short edge: "<</Duplex true/Tumble true>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Duplex
*UIConstraints: *PageSize TA3 *Duplex DuplexNoTumble
*UIConstraints: *PageSize TA3 *Duplex DuplexTumble
*UIConstraints: *MediaType Photo *InputSlot Cassette
